  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Livelihood +: Economic Intergration of Internally Displaced People and Persons affected by Conflict</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">While the delivery of life-saving humanitarian assistance remains critical more than a year into the full-scale war in Ukraine, targeted action to promote economic resilience, early recovery, durable solutions are needed in tandem to support local integration and prevent communities from backsliding into humanitarian dependence. IOM therefore proposes a project that aims to contribute to the improved integration of IDPs, social cohesion and employment access in Ukraine&#x2019;s Chernihiv, Kyiv and Sumy regions.</narrative>
  </description>
